      "content": "i know, i've heard that, but my doctor is way too busy and it takes weeks to get an appointment. i just want some relief from these cramps so i can sleep at night. if i just took one small dose, like one 99mg pill once a day, would that be okay? it seems like such a tiny amount, surely it wouldn't mess up my kidneys that much? it's much better than just suffering through it.",
